Z||000005||fierosound||03-08-2000||10:57 PM||||I think alot of people were getting ready to "send in their money very soon".  At least 29 others according to Tim, but obviously timing is a concern.  <P>I'm sure Tim didn't want to wait 3 months for everyone to get their cash in.  It also wouldn't have been fair to those who sent in on the first week of notification.  <P>It's those 29 other "interested" parties that need their butts kicked.  They left a message on the website saying they'd be interested if the system became available again.  I believe they reconfirmed when Tim email them news they would be produced.  If cash were a problem, they could just get an advance on the credit card and get the damn thing!<P>Reminds me of the guy who was asked why he bought a new $25,000 truck.  His response, "the old one needed a new battery, but they wanted CASH for that."<P><p>[This message has been edited by fierosound (edited 03-09-2000).]||||reg||10
